@@ -0,0 +1,5 @@
+---
+'@radix-ui/react-slot': patch
+---
+
+Slot: Fix infinite re-render loop in React 19 due to unstable composed ref identity. Use `useComposedRefs` so the composed ref is memoized across renders.
